*DS_Store

# Python venvs and caches, wherever they are — deliberately unanchored.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Leftovers from the July 2026 move to cassandra-platform. research/ and verifier/ were
# removed from this repo, and their own .gitignore files went with them — which un-ignored
# 154 MB of vendored venv and regenerable build output still sitting in the working tree.
# A plain `git add -A` staged 1325 files of it. These entries make that impossible even if
# the directories are still on someone's disk.
/research/
/verifier/
